{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_haak_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_haak_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "驚弓一夜",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_haak_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "25502c756d98eb2ec37e8825e657761431004b40712b22515afbc88d7d9fb698",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "text": "老大，你怎麼樣了？傷口還痛嗎？撐住，我這就帶你去醫院。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "痛苦的男人",
      "text": "嘶......阿振，別，不能去醫院，會、會被發現的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "強壯的男人",
      "text": "你個蠢蛋，我們去醫院豈不是自投羅網，那些大夫都精明得很，一看到傷勢就知道不對勁了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "text": "老于，這......這可怎麼辦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "強壯的男人",
      "text": "我聽說這巷子前面有個小診所，去那裡碰碰運氣吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "text": "小診所的醫生少，好控制，老大，要不我們......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "痛苦的男人",
      "text": "行......走，我、我覺得可以。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "text": "堅持住，老大，我們這就帶你去。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "窗戶......都鎖好了，還有窗簾......一絲縫隙都不能留。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "床底下的東西......我看看......\n挺好，都在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "還有......啊，對，還有門得反鎖起來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "幸好想起來了，差點就忘......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "（誰——？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "（是不相熟的面孔......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "你好，請問找誰？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "醫生，這裡有醫生嗎？我大哥、我大哥受傷了，您好心救救命。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "診所已經關門了，先生你明天再來吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "醫生，你、你怎麼能見死不救呢？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "要是真有那麼嚴重，你們應該趕緊去正規的大醫院醫治，而不是半夜來敲我這間街邊小診所的門。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "再糾纏下去，只能說明你大哥離死還遠著呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "喂！你說出這樣的話還算是個醫生嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "哼，好笑，誰告訴你我是個醫生了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "放棄吧，這門踹不開的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "*龍門粗口*......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "（是走了嗎......？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "惴惴不安的醫生屏住呼吸，伸長脖子從門鏡處朝外看，看到門簷下已經沒了人影。\n他不放心，又把耳朵湊近門板，過了好一會，確定再沒有響動，才定下神來，捂著胸口長出一口氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "（嚇死了，還以為是老東西的仇人找上門來了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "想不到這麼晚了還有人上門求診，真是古怪......不會是前幾天救過的老頭又在大肆宣揚我的醫術吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "煩死了，早知道就放著不管了，明明當時想好了的，光治些頭疼腦熱的病，賺點錢夠生活就可以了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "......嘖，可那老頭的怪病是真教人手癢啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "這地方應該不能久留了。老東西得罪了那麼多人，說不定消息就傳到誰耳朵裡了，被人找上門來也是遲早的事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "不行......我得換個地方過了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "唉，真是晦氣，好不容易過了半年安生日子......這躲躲藏藏的，什麼時候才是個頭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "嗯——？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "（該死......剛剛忘記把後門反鎖上了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "text": "嘿嘿，先生，你這後門比起前門來，可是不牢靠得多啊，用鐵絲捅個幾下就能撬開。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "哼，看來你們老大的傷還真是挺嚴重的啊，一刻都等不及？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "強壯的男人",
      "text": "小子，我勸你識相些，趕緊來醫治我老大，他要是有個三長兩短，你的小命也別想要了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "痛苦的男人",
      "text": "小兄弟，我......你救我這次，我以後絕不、絕不虧待你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "你們一個唱紅臉，一個唱白臉，唱得可真好聽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "text": "哎，先生，這就是你想多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "呵，你呢，你又是唱的什麼臉？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "text": "我唱什麼臉都行，但你可別給臉不要臉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "好大的口——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "嘶！你個混帳！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "哎，你們做什麼，別動我，別動我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "痛苦的男人",
      "text": "別叫喚了，小兄弟，你還是老實些，咳咳......想想怎麼治好我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "痛苦的男人",
      "text": "呃......嘶......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "強壯的男人",
      "text": "小子，你下手有點輕重沒？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "我在縫合傷口，你看不到嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "text": "哎，老于，好了好了。先生啊，你這就沒有什麼麻醉劑嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "我這樣的小診所沒有那種東西，嫌疼就不要上這裡來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "我的藥劑瓶！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "強壯的男人",
      "text": "要是不想損失更多就注意你說話的語氣！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "（冷靜，冷靜，他一個胳膊有我兩個腿粗......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "......行，我和你老大說說話，分散分散他的注意力總行了吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "哎，你還能答上話嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "痛苦的男人",
      "text": "說你的，手別、別停。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "你這背上的傷是怎麼弄的？簡直皮開肉綻。比畫著量下來，從肩膀到後腰，快有二十釐米了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "痛苦的男人",
      "text": "鐵欄杆上的尖刺劃的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "你們翻牆了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "......請問，我的話冒犯到諸位了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "強壯的男人",
      "text": "不該問的別亂問。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "（忍耐，忍耐，我手上沒有可以對付他們的藥......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "那......你們是怎麼找到這裡來的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "強壯的男人",
      "text": "有人告訴我的，這裡有間小診所，以前他來過。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "所以，你們過來就僅僅是為了治傷嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "痛苦的男人",
      "text": "不......不然呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "就沒有什麼人和你們說過我的事？比如......我之前遇到的一些“病患”？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "痛苦的男人",
      "text": "不關心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "（看來他們只不過是三個小角色......是我反應過度了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "和你聊天真費勁，算了，我把收音機打開，你對著它講話吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "（嘖，既然不是來尋仇的黑幫，落在我手裡，算你們倒楣。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "收音機",
      "text": "下面緊急播報一條新聞，今日下午六點，龍門珠寶行遭遇一起惡性搶劫事件。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "收音機",
      "text": "三名持短弩的歹徒制服店員，撬開櫃檯，捲走價值數千萬的珠寶後逃走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "收音機",
      "text": "警方表示，劫案發生後，近衛局即刻趕赴案發現場，確認一名店員與歹徒搏鬥後身受重傷，目前正在搶救中。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "收音機",
      "text": "據店員口述，三名在逃歹徒全部戴有面罩，其中一名歹徒背部受傷，應留有傷口。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "（哈......！）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "收音機",
      "text": "望社會各界人士積極提供在逃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "強壯的男人",
      "text": "這破收音機，響個不停，真是煩死人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "還沒等播報聲結束，坐在桌旁的男人便粗魯地按下了關機鍵。\n醫生僵硬地側過頭，看見男人面色不悅，手插進口袋裡，似乎是在摩挲著什麼。\n再低下頭，看著床上那人鮮血淋漓的後背，醫生倒吸一口涼氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "（不妙啊......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "......麻煩了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "強壯的男人",
      "text": "麻煩什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "（吞咽口水）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "呃......還能有什麼，他的傷口啊，我這邊沒有足夠的藥物，只能做些縫合的工作，不能保證後面的恢復情況。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的男人",
      "text": "哎，先生，你站起來幹什麼去？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "醫生",
      "text": "我只是想去打個電話讓人送藥來，你緊張什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
